    "risk_summary": "The fine target F is higher by 14.33 and 30.51 meV/atom than its two controls. Source-force norms are about 0.025–0.037 eV/Å and anisotropic stresses remain. Known Ti–Nb–Ta alloy superconducting wire is a chemistry reference, not this exact ordered ternary.",
