    "route_response": "One three-site target A is contrasted with both the six-site B and the different three-site hexagonal C. All ten λ rows favor A in each contrast; separate Eliashberg gains are 0.842 and 4.841 K. Complete species-channel geometry differences and computed all-σ pairing response are saved against the frozen controls. Cell/grid/method sensitivity prevents a pure geometry-only causal claim; no bandwidth/carrier quantity is substituted.",
