      "novelty": "One exact reduced composition/ordered phase-design group, new to the frozen reviewed cohort. Published computed source is acknowledged, known experimental chemistry remains a comparator. Bounded primary phase search has not tied the exact target order to an established SC sample; no global absence claim.",
      "quantitative_route_response": "One three-site target A is contrasted with both the six-site B and the different three-site hexagonal C. All ten λ rows favor A in each contrast; separate Eliashberg gains are 0.842 and 4.841 K. Complete species-channel geometry differences and computed all-σ pairing response are saved against the frozen controls. Cell/grid/method sensitivity prevents a pure geometry-only causal claim; no bandwidth/carrier quantity is substituted.",
